+### Transferring a user to another organization
+
+- Only an org admin of `{orgID}` may transfer; other callers in that org get 403,
+  callers from another org get 404. The user must belong to `{orgID}` (else 404).
+- `toOrgId` must be an existing organization (one that has users or projects)
+  other than the user's current one (else 400).
+- The user's memberships in projects of the old organization end, and tasks
+  assigned to them there become unassigned (archived projects included), so the
+  model rules keep holding. The tasks themselves stay.
+- Org admin status is not carried over: the user is a plain user in the new org.
+
